# Deterministic four-GPU capacity trace for Qwen1.5-MoE-A2.7B (the available
# Qwen2.7B-class checkpoint). It uses the same capacity formula as the Tiny
# trace but is a distinct workload trace. The lower bound is 2 GPUs because
# this checkpoint needs TP2 on 16-GiB cards; node-0/node-1 are rotated out at
# 120s to model preemption while node-2/node-3 keep a legal TP2 target.
# capacity(t)=clip(round(2 + 1.3*sin(2*pi*t/180s)
#   + 0.7*sin(2*pi*t/70s) + burst(t)), 2, 4).
